# S09: e1m1 from above, outside the world: the potentially visible set of the player's
# start (480,-352,110) drawn textured, every culled polygon as a slate wireframe. The
# camera cranes up and back over file seconds 1 to 3, until the whole map's culled
# wireframe surrounds the small textured set. Classic at 320x200.

map e1m1

duration 4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 1  480,-150,800   72,90  ease inout
key 3  520,60,1350    60,90

vis 480,-352,110
wire world through culled

events on
